{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "string;",
  "title": "Notion Databases Spec",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Notion Databases Spec"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Here’s a spec-style breakdown of **Notion databases** and how they handle **custom properties**, written as if you were rebuilding a comparable rich datatable system from scratch:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. Core Concept"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A **Notion Database** is a **typed collection of items** (called *pages*) stored in a **schema-defined table**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Each database defines:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Columns (properties)** → metadata definitions (name, type, options)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Rows (items)** → instances of pages conforming to the schema"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Views** → UI filters and layouts (table, gallery, board, list, calendar)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Think of it as a **typed object store with composable visual projections**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. Schema Model"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Each database has a schema describing its available fields."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type PropertySchema = {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "id: string;              // stable UUID"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "name: string;            // human-readable key"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type: PropertyType;      // see below"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "options?: PropertyOptions;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "};"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type PropertyType ="
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| \"title\" | \"rich_text\" | \"number\" | \"select\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| \"multi_select\" | \"date\" | \"checkbox\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| \"relation\" | \"rollup\" | \"formula\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| \"people\" | \"files\" | \"url\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| \"email\" | \"phone_number\" | \"status\";"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type PropertyOptions = {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "format?: string;         // e.g. \"USD\" for number"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "options?: Array<{ id: string; name: string; color?: string }>;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "relation?: { database_id: string; synced?: boolean };"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "rollup?: { relation_property: string; target_property: string; function: RollupFunction };"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "formula?: { expression: string };"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "};"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Data Model (Rows / Pages)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Each row is a **page object** with values matching the schema."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Values are stored as **typed payloads**, often wrapped in arrays for multi-valued properties."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type DatabaseRow = {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "id: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "created_time: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "last_edited_time: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "properties: Record<string, PropertyValue>;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "};"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Each `PropertyValue` structure is determined by its schema type:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type PropertyValue ="
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| { type: \"title\"; title: RichText[] }"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| { type: \"rich_text\"; rich_text: RichText[] }"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| { type: \"number\"; number: number | null }"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| { type: \"select\"; select: Option | null }"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| { type: \"multi_select\"; multi_select: Option[] }"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| { type: \"date\"; date: { start: string; end?: string } | null }"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| { type: \"checkbox\"; checkbox: boolean }"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| { type: \"relation\"; relation: { id: string }[] }"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| { type: \"rollup\"; rollup: { type: string; value: any } }"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| { type: \"formula\"; formula: { type: string; value: any } };"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. Rendering Logic (Frontend)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A **rich datatable component** should support:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-65",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Dynamic schema awareness:** Columns adjust to schema types."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-66",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Type-based editors:** Each cell uses a renderer/editor tied to its type."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- `select` → dropdown with color tags"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- `multi_select` → multi-chip input"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- `date` → datepicker"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- `relation` → link selector modal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- `rollup` / `formula` → read-only computed cell"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-75",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-73",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Inline editing:** Debounced patch requests per cell edit"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-74",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Type-safe sorting, filtering, and grouping**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-76",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Each property definition acts as both **schema and UI contract**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-77",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-78",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. Custom Property Handling"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-79",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Notion databases allow runtime addition/removal of columns:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-81",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-80",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "When a new property is added:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-82",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Schema updated with a new property ID and default type."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-83",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Each existing row gains a `null` entry for that property."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-85",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-84",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "When a property type changes:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-86",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- All existing values are coerced or cleared based on the new type."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-88",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-87",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "When a property is deleted:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-89",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- It’s removed from schema and pruned from each page."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-90",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Schema migrations are **non-breaking** when possible; they maintain property IDs to preserve view configurations and rollups."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-91",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-92",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. Derived Property Types"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-94",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-93",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Relations:** Many-to-many link between databases."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-95",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Backed by IDs referencing target pages."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-98",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-96",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Rollups:** Computed fields aggregating data from related items (e.g., COUNT, SUM)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-97",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Formulas:** Inline expressions compiled into a mini expression language (tree-based AST evaluated client-side)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-99",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-100",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "7. Data Access Layer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-101",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Abstract operations for your backend or local-first layer:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-102",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-103",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "interface DatabaseAPI {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-104",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "list(databaseId: string, filters?: Filter[], sorts?: Sort[]): DatabaseRow[];"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-105",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "get(databaseId: string, pageId: string): DatabaseRow;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-106",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "update(databaseId: string, pageId: string, properties: Partial<DatabaseRow[\"properties\"]>): void;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-107",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "create(databaseId: string, data: Partial<DatabaseRow>): DatabaseRow;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-108",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "delete(databaseId: string, pageId: string): void;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-109",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "alterSchema(databaseId: string, updates: SchemaPatch): void;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-110",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-111",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-112",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Where `SchemaPatch` describes add/rename/delete/type-change actions."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-113",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-114",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "8. Persistence Model"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-115",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Internally, Notion persists:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-120",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-116",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Schema JSON** describing column structure."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-117",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Row JSON blobs** for each page."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-118",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Indexes** for sorting/filtering."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-119",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Relations** as bidirectional mappings."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-121",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "For a local rebuild, you could use:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-125",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-122",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "JSON files or SQLite for persistence"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-123",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "IndexedDB for client caching"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-124",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "CRDT-based patches for real-time collaboration"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-126",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-127",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "9. View Configuration"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-128",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A *View* defines how the same data appears:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-129",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-130",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type View = {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-131",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "id: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-132",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type: \"table\" | \"board\" | \"gallery\" | \"calendar\" | \"list\";"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-133",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "filters?: Filter[];"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-134",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "sorts?: Sort[];"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-135",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "visible_properties: string[];"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-136",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "group_by?: string;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-137",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "};"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-138",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-139",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Each view queries the same canonical dataset but applies visual transformations."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-140",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-141",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "10. Summary"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-142",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In essence, Notion’s database system is:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-147",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-143",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A **typed key-value schema** per collection"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-144",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A **rich renderer layer** that treats schema types as UI primitives"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-145",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A **composable relation and computed field model**"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-146",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A **schema-driven CRUD API** with dynamic extensibility"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-148",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If you rebuild it, treat **the schema as the source of truth** for both validation and rendering — your datatable is just a live projection of that schema-bound object graph."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-149",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-150",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Would you like me to extend this spec to include **formula evaluation and rollup computation** (how Notion calculates dependent fields)?"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}